The Freman College Diversity Committee meet once a fortnight in Barber from 1:30pm - 2:00pm on Wednesdays. The group discusses diversity within Freman College.
Celebrating Diversity Through Food
As a celebration of diversity this half term, the committee have been collaborating with our canteen staff to explore diversity through food. Once a month, to coincide with the assembly themes, the Canteen will be offering foods from around the world to enable students to learn about other cultures and discover new flavours.
