Where Legends Rest
Discover the Cars That Changed the Road
13 July – 31 October
Step into a world where automotive history comes alive. The Deerfields Mall Classic Car Museum showcases a remarkable collection of vintage automobiles that represent timeless craftsmanship, engineering excellence, and unforgettable stories from generations past.
Available for a limited time, from 13 July to 31 October, this special exhibition invites visitors to experience some of the world's most iconic classic vehicles in one extraordinary destination.
Journey Through Automotive History
Travel through the evolution of motoring as you explore beautifully restored classic vehicles from different eras. From luxurious vintage sedans to legendary touring automobiles, every exhibit reflects the passion, innovation, and artistry that transformed transportation forever.
Whether you're a classic car enthusiast, history lover, photographer, or visiting with family, the museum offers an inspiring experience for all ages.
