THROUGH WATCHING TOGETHER THE FILM "TRINIL" GEN Z LEGISLATIVE CANDIDATE NADJA AZZURA TOHIR INVITES THE YOUNG GENERATION TO LOVE INDONESIAN FILM
Bogor - 21 January 2024 - The Indonesian film industry has continued to grow rapidly in recent years. This is proven by the large number of films released every year, as well as the increasing number of Indonesian films penetrating the international market. In supporting the development of the Indonesian film industry, Nadja Azzura Tohir, Legislative Candidate (Caleg) for the National Mandate Party (PAN) DPRD for the South Bogor Electoral District, invites the younger generation to watch Indonesian films together.
This group viewing was attended by 150 young people from various regions in South Bogor. They seemed enthusiastic about following the film Trinil: Return My Body, an Indonesian horror film that tells the story of love, family, and also the mystery of the exorcism of the Rahayu spirit.
Nadja said that this nobar event was held in order to support the development of the Indonesian film industry. According to him, "By watching Indonesian films, we can show that we are proud of Indonesian culture, and support the growth of the national creative industry."
This activity was also attended directly by the actor Rahayu Muda or Shalom Razade who is also a friend of Nadja Azzura Tohir. He said *"thank you for your support for Indonesian films, I am sure that if my friend, Nadja is elected as a representative of the people of South Bogor, the creative industry will be even more advanced"*
Faraby, a young man from South Bogor, said, "This film is really cool apart from having jump scare horror, but it also really feels sad because it tells a family story. "The film Trinil: Return My Body is one of the Indonesian horror films that must be watched." he said
The Indonesian film screening event held by Nadja Azzura Tohir is proof that Indonesian youth, especially generation Z, are increasingly aware of the importance of supporting the Indonesian film industry. With support from various parties, it is hoped that the Indonesian film industry can continue to develop rapidly and become a host in its own country.
Reporter : Marno

In today’s article, we will explore various types of agreements and their significance in different fields. From post adoption agreement forms to agreements in restraint of trade, we have you covered!
Post Adoption Agreement Form
First on our list is the post adoption agreement form. This form outlines the terms and conditions agreed upon by adoptive parents and birth parents after the adoption process. It helps ensure that both parties are aware of their rights and responsibilities.
Agreement for Sale Meaning in Marathi
The agreement for sale is a legal document that defines the terms of a property sale in Marathi. It is important to understand the meaning and implications of this agreement before entering into a property transaction.
Free Rent Agreement UK
The free rent agreement in the UK offers a comprehensive template that landlords and tenants can use when renting a property without having to pay any fees. It ensures that both parties are protected and aware of their rights and obligations.
Agreements in Restraint of Trade
Agreements in restraint of trade are contracts that restrict an individual’s freedom to engage in a certain trade or profession. These agreements are often used to protect trade secrets or prevent competition.
Transition Services Agreement Oil and Gas
A transition services agreement in the oil and gas industry is a contract between two parties involved in a business transition, such as a merger or acquisition. It outlines the services to be provided during the transition period and helps facilitate a smooth handover.
Terms of Agreement Subway
The terms of agreement for Subway, a popular fast food chain, are the conditions that franchisees must adhere to when operating a Subway restaurant. These terms cover various aspects, including branding, operations, and marketing.
Life Rent Agreement
A life rent agreement is a legal arrangement where the tenant has the right to occupy a property for their entire lifetime without becoming the property owner. It provides security and stability for the tenant.
Electrical Service Contract Agreement
An electrical service contract agreement is a written agreement between a service provider and a client for the provision of electrical services. It outlines the scope, terms, and conditions of the service, ensuring transparency and accountability.
Sublease Agreement On
A sublease agreement allows a tenant to lease their rented property to another party, known as the subtenant. This agreement ensures that all parties involved are aware of their rights and obligations during the sublease period.
A wagering agreement is a contract where two or more parties agree to place a bet on the outcome of a specific event. This agreement defines the terms and conditions of the wager, including the amount of the bet and the payout structure.

